-PCR</article-title><source>Diagn Microbiol Infect Dis</source><year>2001</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>15</fpage><lpage>19</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11173186</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0732-8893(00)00216-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morozumi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Murayama</surname><given-names>SY</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasegawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kobayashi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Iwata</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawamura</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuroki</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakayama</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Tajima</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ubukata</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Assessment of real-time PCR for diagnosis of Mycoplasma pneumoniae pneumonia in pediatric patients</article-title><source>Can J Microbiol</source><year>2006</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16541148</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1139/w05-118</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morozumi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakayama</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Iwata</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Aoki</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasegawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kobayashi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiba</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><